1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:04,730
TierSaver keeps your Klaviyo list clean. You approve every cleanup.

2
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:11,990
Step 1: run the audit. It changes no profile.

3
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:15,990
The audit counts profiles that never opened, clicked, visited or purchased.

4
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:20,820
Buyers, SMS subscribers and new profiles are kept active.

5
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:26,840
Step 2: review the simulation.

6
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:30,760
Download the candidate list and check it.

7
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:39,940
Read the notices: what suppressing does, how to restore, the plan.

8
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:48,460
Step 3: tick the box and approve. Shopify asks you to confirm the plan.

9
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:53,490
Step 4: start the cleanup. Profiles are suppressed, never deleted.

10
00:00:53,490 --> 00:01:00,860
Each profile is checked again right before it is sent to Klaviyo.

11
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:05,860
Done. The cleanup is logged: who approved it, which rule, how many profiles.

12
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:14,670
Made a mistake? Restore removes the suppression this cleanup added.

13
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:25,860
Settings: criteria, protected lists, monthly schedule and your plan.

14
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:30,860
TierSaver: list hygiene for Klaviyo.
